<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},
<p>Thank you for contacting the Qantas Customer Care team about your booking reference {{{Case.Booking_PNR__c}}}.</p>

<p><b>-<i>If chasing refund on refundable ticket now refunded use:</i></b></p>

<p><strong>Your refund is on&nbsp; its way</strong><br />
Our ticketing department have confirmed that your refund has been processed. You should see the amount credited to the original form of payment within 7 business days.</p>

<p><b>-<i>If non refundable ticket booked online use:-</i></b></p>

<p><strong>Our Fare Conditions</strong><br />
We understand things don’t always go to plan and you were unable to travel with us on this occasion.<br />
<br />
We do our best to make sure that our customers understand our fare types and conditions before booking a flight with us.<br />
<br />
As your fare type is non-refundable, you are not eligible for a refund. However, the tax amount of &lt;$00.00&gt; AUD has been refunded to the original form of payment on &lt;date&gt;.</p>

<p><b>-<i>If non refundable ticket booked through Contact Centres use:-</i></b></p>

<p><strong>Our Fare Conditions</strong><br />
We understand things don’t always go to plan and you were unable to travel with us on this occasion.<br />
<br />
When making a booking through our contact centres, the booking terms and conditions are explained before proceeding with the booking.<br />
<br />
Because your fare type is non-refundable, you are not eligible for a refund.</p>

<p><strong><em>-If non-refundable ticket and listened to the call, add:</em></strong></p>

<p><strong>Our Fare Conditions</strong><br />
I’ve listened to your call and confirmed that the consultant you spoke to on &lt;Date&gt; went through the conditions and you agreed to them before providing your payment details. Because your fare type is non-refundable, we are unable to offer you a refund.<br />
<br />
<strong>We’re here to help&nbsp;</strong><br />
I understand you’re disappointed we’re unable to offer you a refund. However, your travel insurance provider may be able to help cover these sorts of situations.<br />
<br />
Let me know if you’d like me to provide you with an insurance letter to assist you with a claim — we’re here to help.</p>
</body>
